# Implementation Plan — Lead Growth V2.0 Enterprise SaaS Transformation

This plan details the full transformation of Lead Growth into a production-grade enterprise SaaS platform matching HubSpot, Salesforce, Monday.com, and Zoho CRM standards. Every component will be connected end-to-end (UI → API → MySQL Database → WebSocket Sync → Role Enforcement).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict Role-Based Dashboard Architecture**:
> - **Admin Dashboard (`Business Command Center`)**: Agency Owner view. Focuses on Total Revenue, Ad Spend, ROAS, Net Profit, Workspace Health, Team Productivity, System Health (API, DB, WebSockets, Scheduler), Audit Logs, and Billing controls.
> - **Manager Dashboard (`Operations Control Center`)**: Team Leader view. Focuses on Team Workload, Capacity, Lead Queue, Task Review & Approvals, Task Assignment, Team Productivity Leaderboard, and Non-Admin User Management.
> - **User Dashboard (`Personal Productivity Hub`)**: Sales Executive view. Focuses ONLY on "My Assigned Leads", "My Active Tasks", "My Follow-up Reminders", "My Conversion Rate", "My Quality Score", and "My Gamified Ranking". Restricts all revenue, profit, billing, API keys, and workspace settings.

> [!NOTE]
> **New Enterprise Subsystems**:
> 1. **Lead Queue & Automated Distribution Engine**: Handles incoming leads from Meta Ads, Google Ads, and Landing Pages into a central queue for manual or hybrid auto-assignment.
> 2. **User Idle Prevention Sweep**: Triggers upon task/lead completion to automatically draw next priority items from the queue.
> 3. **Follow-up Reminders Engine**: Tracks Upcoming, Pending, Missed, and Completed lead follow-ups.
> 4. **Audit Log System**: Full audit trail of security and operational actions with filterable Admin Audit Viewer.
> 5. **Export & Report Exporter**: PDF, Excel, and CSV report exporter for workspace performance.

