## Proposed Changes

---

### Backend Layer (`/backend`)

#### [NEW] [AuditLog.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/entity/AuditLog.java) & [AuditLogRepository.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/repository/AuditLogRepository.java)
- Create AuditLog entity and repository for recording all system/user mutations (`USER_CREATED`, `USER_SUSPENDED`, `LEAD_ASSIGNED`, `TASK_APPROVED`, `CAMPAIGN_MODIFIED`, `WORKSPACE_UPDATED`).

#### [NEW] [FollowupReminder.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/entity/FollowupReminder.java) & [FollowupRepository.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/repository/FollowupRepository.java)
- Create entity for tracking lead follow-ups: `lead`, `assignedTo`, `scheduledAt`, `status` (`UPCOMING`, `PENDING`, `COMPLETED`, `MISSED`), `notes`.

#### [MODIFY] [Lead.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/entity/Lead.java)
- Add fields for Lead Quality: `qualityScore` (0-100), `qualityTier` (`HOT`, `WARM`, `COLD`), `conversionProbability` (0-100%), `queueStatus` (`IN_QUEUE`, `ASSIGNED`, `ARCHIVED`).

#### [MODIFY] [DashboardService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/DashboardService.java) & [DashboardController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/DashboardController.java)
- Add role-tailored dashboard DTOs:
  - `AdminDashboardDto`: Revenue, Spend, ROAS, Net Profit, Workspace Stats, System Health, Audit Logs, Active vs Suspended count.
  - `ManagerDashboardDto`: Team Workload, Task Review Queue, Team Capacity, Lead Queue, Leaderboard, Productivity metrics.
  - `UserDashboardDto`: My Leads, My Tasks, My Followups, My Conversion Rate, My Quality Score, My Ranking.

#### [NEW] [LeadQueueService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/LeadQueueService.java) & [LeadQueueController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/LeadQueueController.java)
- Implement Lead Queue Engine:
  - Add leads to Queue from Facebook, Meta Ads, Google Ads, Forms.
  - Manual and Auto-Assignment via Hybrid Algorithm (Availability, Workload, Round Robin).
  - User Idle Prevention trigger when tasks/leads complete.

#### [NEW] [FollowupService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/FollowupService.java) & [FollowupController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/FollowupController.java)
- CRUD endpoints for managing lead follow-ups, automatic missed reminder checks, and completion updates.

#### [NEW] [AuditLogController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/AuditLogController.java)
- Endpoint `GET /api/admin/audit-logs` restricted to `ROLE_ADMIN`.

#### [NEW] [ExportController.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/controller/ExportController.java) & [ExportService.java](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/backend/src/main/java/com/leadgrowth/service/ExportService.java)
- Generate CSV, Excel (CSV compatible), and HTML/PDF formatted report exports for Leads, Campaigns, and Team Productivity.

